	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0101_swplazmam3_03_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あがけ　あがけ！▼
レシラムの　ひばしら
ゼクロムの　いなずま　よりも▽
キュレムの　こおりが　うえだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T12:44:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T12:11:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あがけ　あがけ！▼
レシラムの　火柱
ゼクロムの　稲妻　よりも▽
キュレムの　氷塊が　上だ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T12:44:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T12:11:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
