				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T12:45:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T12:11:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>イッシュの　すべてが！
キュレムの　氷で！▼
……ヴィオさま　大丈夫かな
あんなに　寒がり　なのに</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T12:45:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
