	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0101_swboss_end_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたと　ポケモンとの　あいだに
そんざいする　みえない　ちから……▽
こんどこそ　みきわめます！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T07:16:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T06:24:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたと　ポケモンとの　あいだに
存在する　みえない　力……▽
今度こそ　見極めます！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T07:17:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T06:24:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい選択時
　続けて戦闘に（トレーナーIDはd27r0401と同じ）</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T06:27:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBOSS
アクロマ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T06:24:44" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0101_swboss_end_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わざわざ　ここまで
あしを　はこんだというのに……▽
つれない　ひと　ですね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T07:13:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T06:24:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わざわざ　ここまで
足を　運んだというのに……▽
つれない　人ですね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T07:17:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T06:24:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・いいえ選択時</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T06:27:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBOSS
アクロマ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
