	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0101_swboss_end_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さあ　あなた！
しばし　つきあいなさい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T07:13:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T06:24:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さあ　あなた！
しばし　つきあいなさい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T07:16:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T06:24:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→swboss_end_02
　いいえ→swboss_end_03</Comment>
